    "homeType": "MULTI_FAMILY",
    "description": "Discover an exceptional investment and owner-occupancy opportunity in San Francisco's coveted Inner Richmond. Built in 1986, 467 7th Avenue proudly features three spacious residential units plus a bonus ground-floor unit with potential to legalize as an ADU, perfect for creating additional income or extended family living.  The top-floor owner's unit offers approximately 1,800 sq. ft. with 3 bedrooms and 2 baths, abundant natural light, and a functional floor plan. Two identical 2-bed/1-bath flats on the lower level, each with comfortable layouts and strong rental demand. The ground-floor space provides finished bonus rooms ready for conversion or flexible use. A full-depth lot creates possibilities for outdoor enjoyment or additional value-add improvements.    Located just steps from Clement Street's dining corridor, boutique markets, and local parks, this property combines convenience, charm, and long-term upside. With transit, Golden Gate Park, and some of San Francisco's best restaurants just blocks away, residents enjoy a vibrant neighborhood feel and strong rental appeal."
